Table full name: isb-cgc-bq.HTAN_versioned.imaging_level3_segmentation_metadata_r5
Column name: Imaging_Object_Class Type: STRING Description: Defines the structure that the mask delineates
Column name: Parameter_file Type: STRING Description: Path in Syanpse to a text file listing algorithm version numbers and relevant parameters needed to reproduce the analysis
Column name: Filename Type: STRING Description: Name of a file
Column name: HTAN_Parent_Data_File_ID Type: STRING Description: HTAN Data File Identifier indicating the file(s) from which these files were derived
Column name: entityId Type: STRING Description: Synapse ID of entity
Column name: Id Type: STRING Description: Unique identifier of entity e.g. a96059eb-81af-4b24-ae50-9242c0d8f819
Column name: HTAN_Data_File_ID Type: STRING Description: Self-identifier for this data file - HTAN ID of this file HTAN ID SOP (eg HTANx_yyy_zzz)
Column name: Imaging_Segmentation_Data_Type Type: STRING Description: Specifies how the segmentation is stored
Column name: Component Type: STRING Description: Category of metadata (e.g. Diagnosis, Biospecimen, scRNA-seq Level 1, etc.); provide the same one for all items/rows.
Column name: Imaging_Object_Class_Description Type: STRING Description: Free text description of object class [string]
Column name: Number_of_Objects Type: STRING Description: The number of objects (eg cells) described
Column name: Commit_SHA Type: STRING Description: Short SHA for software version [8 hexadecimal characters (for github), comma separated if multiple]
Column name: Software_and_Version Type: STRING Description: Name of software used to generate expression values. String
Column name: File_Format Type: STRING Description: Format of a file (e.g. txt, csv, fastq, bam, etc.)
Column name: HTAN_Center Type: STRING Description: Name of HTAN Center e.g. HTAN HTAPP
Column name: Manifest_Id Type: STRING Description: Synapse ID of manifest containing file annotation
Column name: Manifest_Version Type: INT64 Description: Latest version of metadata manifest
Column name: File_Size Type: INT64 Description: Size of file (bucket object) in bytes
Column name: md5 Type: STRING Description: md5 hash of file
Column name: Data_Release Type: STRING Description: Inclusion in HTAN Data Release e.g. Release 1.0
Column name: CDS_Release Type: STRING Description: CDS transfer package in which file was included e.g. v22.6.1.seq
