Column name: Pyramid Type: STRING Description: Does data file contain pyramid of images
Column name: Channel_Metadata_Filename Type: STRING Description: Full path within Synapse project of uploaded companion CSV file containing channel-level metadata details
Column name: Frame_Averaging Type: STRING Description: Number of frames averaged together (if no averaging, set to 1). Integer >= 1
Column name: PlaneCount Type: STRING Description: Number of Z-planes (not to be confused with downsampled "pyramid"). Integer >=1
Column name: PhysicalSizeXUnit Type: STRING Description: The units of the physical size of a pixel. See OME enumeration of allowed values for the UnitsLength attribute -- default: microns (um)
Column name: MERFISH_Codebook_File Type: STRING Description: The codebook is an auxiliary MERFISH file that describes how each grouping of bits is converted to a gene name.
Column name: Objective Type: STRING Description: Objective
Column name: DimensionOrder Type: STRING Description: The order in which the individual planes of data are interleaved.
Column name: WorkingDistanceUnit Type: STRING Description: The units of the working distance. See OME enumeration of allowed values for the UnitsLength attribute -- default: microns (um)
Column name: Image_ID Type: STRING Description: Unique internal image identifier. eg "Image:0". (To be extracted from OME-XML)
Column name: HTAN_Data_File_ID Type: STRING Description: Self-identifier for this data file - HTAN ID of this file HTAN ID SOP (eg HTANx_yyy_zzz)
Column name: Component Type: STRING Description: Category of metadata (e.g. Diagnosis, Biospecimen, scRNA-seq Level 1, etc.); provide the same one for all items/rows.
Column name: FOVX Type: STRING Description: Field of view X dimension. Floating point
Column name: Imaging_Assay_Type Type: STRING Description: Type of imaging assay
Column name: Comment Type: STRING Description: Free text field (generally for QC comment)
Column name: FOV_number Type: STRING Description: Index of FOV (as it pertains to its sequence order). Integer >= 1
Column name: FOVY Type: STRING Description: Field  of view Y dimension. Floating point value
Column name: Zstack Type: STRING Description: Does data file contain a Z-stack of images
Column name: SizeC Type: STRING Description: Number of channels. Integer >= 1
Column name: PhysicalSizeY Type: STRING Description: Physical size (Y-dimension) of a pixel. Units are set by PhysicalSizeYUnit. Floating point value > 0.
Column name: SizeX Type: STRING Description: Size of image: X dimension (in pixels). Integer >= 1
Column name: HTAN_Parent_Data_File_ID Type: STRING Description: HTAN Data File Identifier indicating the file(s) from which these files were derived
Column name: HTAN_Parent_Biospecimen_ID Type: STRING Description: HTAN Biospecimen Identifier (eg HTANx_yyy_zzz) indicating the biospecimen(s) from which these files were derived; multiple parent biospecimen should be comma-separated
Column name: Passed_QC Type: STRING Description: Did all channels pass QC (if not add free text Comment)
Column name: Filename Type: STRING Description: Name of a file
Column name: PhysicalSizeX Type: STRING Description: Physical size (X-dimension) of a pixel. Units are set by PhysicalSizeXUnit. Floating point value > 0.
Column name: Microscope Type: STRING Description: Microscope type (manufacturer, model, etc) used for this experiment
Column name: entityId Type: STRING Description: Synapse ID of entity
Column name: SizeT Type: STRING Description: Number of time points. Integer >= 1
Column name: PixelType Type: STRING Description: Data type for each pixel value. E.g. "uint16"
Column name: PhysicalSizeZ Type: STRING Description: Physical size (Z-dimension) of a pixel. Units are set by PhysicalSizeZUnit. Floating point value > 0.
Column name: Protocol_Link Type: STRING Description: Protocols.io ID or DOI link to a free/open protocol resource describing in detail the assay protocol (e.g. surface markers used in Smart-seq, dissociation duration,  lot/batch numbers for key reagents such as primers, sequencing reagent kits, etc.) or the protocol by which the sample was obtained or generated.
Column name: SizeY Type: STRING Description: Size of image: Y dimension (in pixels). Integer >= 1
Column name: Pixels_BigEndian Type: STRING Description: Boolean (True/False)
Column name: HTAN_Participant_ID Type: STRING Description: HTAN ID associated with a patient based on HTAN ID SOP (eg HTANx_yyy )
Column name: PhysicalSizeYUnit Type: STRING Description: The units of the physical size of a pixel. See OME enumeration of allowed values for the UnitsLength attribute -- default: microns (um)
Column name: FOVYUnit Type: STRING Description: Field of view Y dimension units. See OME enumeration of allowed values for the UnitsLength attribute -- default: microns (um)
Column name: LensNA Type: STRING Description: The numerical aperture of the lens. Floating point value > 0.
Column name: NominalMagnification Type: STRING Description: The magnification of the lens as specified by the manufacturer - i.e. '60' is a 60X lens. floating point value > 1(no units)
Column name: SizeZ Type: STRING Description: Size of image: Z dimension (in pixels). Integer >= 1
Column name: Id Type: STRING Description: Unique identifier of entity e.g. a96059eb-81af-4b24-ae50-9242c0d8f819
Column name: Immersion Type: STRING Description: Immersion medium
Column name: FOVXUnit Type: STRING Description: Field of view X dimension units. See OME enumeration of allowed values for the UnitsLength attribute -- default: microns (um)
Column name: PhysicalSizeZUnit Type: STRING Description: The units of the physical size of a pixel. See OME enumeration of allowed values for the UnitsLength attribute -- default: microns (um)
Column name: MERFISH_Positions_File Type: STRING Description: The positions file is an auxiliary MERFISH file that describes the location of bead positions in the assay.
Column name: WorkingDistance Type: STRING Description: The working distance of the lens, expressed as a floating point number. Floating point > 0.
Column name: Tseries Type: STRING Description: Does data file contain a time-series of images
